    // volcanic plugs, the 1394 sale to Wenceslas IV, the Hussite-era
    // sieges, the 1469 capture by George of Poděbrady's forces, the
    // Baba/Panna legend) confirmed via WebSearch.
    name: 'Trosky Castle',
